#### [MODIFY] [workflow.service.ts](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/backend/src/modules/workflow/workflow.service.ts)
- Implement `OnModuleInit` to seed the default "Standard Approval Workflow" configuration.
- Implement `getRules()`, `updateRules()`, and `applyAiRecommendations()` services.
- Refactor `approve()` to dynamically evaluate which workflow level is currently active for the expense, increment its active level or route it to the next level based on limits/conditions, and only mark status as `approved` once all matching levels have been successfully cleared.

