## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Log in as an **Admin** user.
- Click **Team Approvals** in the sidebar. Verify the tab bar with `Approvals Queue` and `Workflow Configuration` is visible.
- Toggle to **Workflow Configuration**. Confirm all 3 workflow levels match the high-fidelity design from Stitch.
- Click **Apply All Recommendations** on the AI Policy Auditor card; verify it updates the standard rules payload and saves successfully.
- Submit an expense with an amount > $50,000. Approve it at Level 1; verify its status is not immediately fully approved but progresses to the next active level (Level 2 & Level 3).
